      "content": "it's not just \"transitions\" though. it's more like the whole foundation of what i knew is gone. everything is loud and digital and empty at the same time. i feel like a book that's been left out in the rain, just blurring and falling apart. i dont want to fight to stay relevant in a world that doesn't have a place for someone like me. it just feels so exhausting to keep pretending i belong.",
